cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and credit the original
  publishing agency (carried on every record as source_name) for any specific
  price you quote.
title: "US public timber stumpage & delivered price data (stumpage.us)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mihiar
    given-names: Chris
repository-code: "https://github.com/mihiarc/stumpage-us"
url: "https://mihiarc.github.io/stumpage-us/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A harmonized, license-clean compilation of US timber price observations
  (stumpage and delivered) from six independent public sources — USFS
  Cut-and-Sold reports, the USFS PNW Research Station PPET series, Michigan
  DNR state-forest sales, Oregon ODF state-forest auctions, Montana DNRC
  trust-land sales, and the University of Montana BBER delivered-price
  survey — 1959–present, carried losslessly in published units with cited,
  scale-explicit conversions to dollars per green ton, and machine-readable
  expert caveats (candor blocks) per source.
keywords:
  - timber prices
  - stumpage
  - forest economics
  - open data
